{"id":870487,"title":"结束语 & 结课测试","content":"<p>到这，课程就结束了，非常感谢你一直以来的认真学习和支持！</p><p>为了帮你检验自己的学习效果，我特意给你准备了一套结课测试题。这套测试题是 16 道单选题 + 4 道多选题，考点都来自我们前面讲到的重要知识。点击下面按钮开始测试吧！</p><p><a href=\"http://time.geekbang.org/quiz/intro?act_id=8833&exam_id=19895\"><img src=\"https://static001.geekbang.org/resource/image/28/a4/28d1be62669b4f3cc01c36466bf811a4.png?wh=1142*201\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>最后，我还给你准备了一份<a href=\"https://jinshuju.com/f/gxS5i4\">结课问卷</a>，希望你能花两三分钟填写一下，非常期待能听到你对这门课的反馈。</p>","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":407728,"user_name":"Cy23","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1591293,"ip_address":"辽宁","ucode":"8DC561C5151758","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/18/47/fd/895f0c27.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1779247524,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101000501,"comment_content":"一直懒，才学完，终于又学完一个","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":399708,"user_name":"大卫高","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1088716,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"0B12DF6AF08E7D","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/9c/cc/b640e578.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1745063154,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101000501,"comment_content":"老师，课件能分享一下吗？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":2825431,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/2b/1c/d7/b81eddcf.jpg","nickname":"毁灭吧","note":"","ucode":"D1D97445158D06","race_medal":0,"user_type":8,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":660008,"discussion_content":"在课程介绍页有课件的链接和地址诶，课件下载链接：https://pan.baidu.com/s/1VQFQ_kC9xz85JLlgUHIJOA （提取码: hs88）","content_length":83,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1745393514,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":